      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_4e17481d4f383268_0",
        "edit": "Change the sensitivity list of the always block from `always@ (clk)` to `always@ (clk or d)` so the latch output updates when the data input changes, matching the expected combinational/level-sensitive behavior.",
